    "text": "newportdispatch.com\nwebsite\nHalfmoon\nWoman arrested for grand larceny at Halfmoon Walmart\nBy Daniel Duric,\n2 hours agoHALFMOON — The Saratoga County Sheriff’s Office responded to an active larceny call Sunday at 5:50 p.m. at Walmart in the town of Halfmoon. Investigation into the matter led to the arrest of Giovanna M. Vardine, 35, of Albany, for grand larceny in the 4th degree, a class E felony.",
